**/.terraform
**/.terraform/*

# .tfstate files
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# .tfvars files
**/*.tfvars

# Saved Terraform plans can contain sensitive values from state and variables.
**/tfplan*

# Terraform lock file
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

**/.DS_Store
**/*.bk

# Editor files
**/.vscode
**/kubeconfig*
**/cat.*
**/test.py
**/.idea

**/wandb/*
**/policy.json

# Rendered W&B custom resources can contain live storage credentials. Keep the
# sanitized CR.template.yaml tracked and ignore environment-specific CR files.
*CR.yaml
